      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this superb four-bedroom semi-detached family home to the market in the highly sought-after and mature development of Hazelbury Park, Clonee. Ideally located just a stone's throw from Clonee Village, situated in a quiet Cul-de-sac, this well presented home benefits from immediate access to a wealth of local amenities, including shops, schools, and popular eateries. For larger retail needs, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is only a short drive away. Commuters will appreciate the convenient access to the M3 and M50 motorways, as well as excellent public transport links serving the area. This is a perfect opportunity to secure a family home in a well-connected and family-friendly location. No. 145 is bright and spacious four-bedroom home in presented in great condition throughout and offers internals living accommodation of c. 145 Sqm. The accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, guest WC, Living room, Dining room, kitchen/breakfast along with a utility room to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find four well-proportioned bedrooms with master benefitting from ensuite as well as the family bathroom. Externally you will encounter a fully enclosed sunny rear garden with a high degree of privacy and side access to the front which offers a driveway for off road parking. Further benefits include gas-fired central heating, double glazed windows and is offered to the market with no onward chain. Based on size and location we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest and book a viewing.\r\n\r\nBER C\r\nc. 124 Sqm\r\n4 Bedrooms\r\n3 bath\r\nHighly sought after development\r\nGated side access\r\nFront driveway\r\nNo onward chain\r\nIdeally located in Cul-de-sac\r\nGas central heating\r\nClose to amenities\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nD15 H3A2"
      },
